        <a class="text-ts-primary underline" href="/privacy">Privacy Policy</a>. We do not sell
        or share this data with third parties for marketing.</p>

      <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold">4. Data &amp; privacy</h2>
      <p>Our collection and use of personal and financial information is described in our
        <a class="text-ts-primary underline" href="/privacy">Privacy Policy</a>, which is
        incorporated into this Agreement by reference.</p>

