      <p>To the maximum extent permitted by law, Tiny Seed Farm shall not be liable for any
        indirect, incidental, special, or consequential damages arising from your use of, or
        inability to use, the Software.</p>

      <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold">7. Termination</h2>
