        Software and, where applicable, revoke any connected third-party integrations (such as
        QuickBooks Online) at any time from within those services.</p>

      <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold">8. Changes</h2>
      <p>We may update this Agreement from time to time; the "Last updated" date above reflects
        the current version. Continued use after changes constitutes acceptance.</p>

      <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold">9. Contact</h2>
      <p>Questions about this Agreement may be directed to
        <a class="text-ts-primary underline" href="mailto:tinyseedfleurs@gmail.com">tinyseedfleurs@gmail.com</a>.</p>

      <p class="pt-4 text-sm text-ts-text-muted">Tiny Seed Farm · Pittsburgh, PA ·
        <a class="text-ts-primary underline" href="https://www.tinyseedfarm.com">tinyseedfarm.com</a></p>
